  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Counter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Counter</h1>\n    <output id=\"count\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</output>\n    <div class=\"controls\">\n      <button id=\"decrease\" aria-label=\"Decrease count\">-</button>\n      <button id=\"reset\" aria-label=\"Reset count to zero\">Reset</button>\n      <button id=\"increase\" aria-label=\"Increase count\">+</button>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1a2e;\n  --card: #16213e;\n  --accent: #e94560;\n  --text: #eaeaea;\n  --muted: #a0a0b0;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  background: var(--bg);\n  color: var(--text);\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  padding: 20px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: 4px solid var(--accent);\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  padding: 40px 30px;\n  text-align: center;\n  max-width: 400px;\n  width: 100%;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px #0f0f1a, 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 1.5rem;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n}\n\n#count {\n  display: block;\n  font-size: 4rem;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n  margin: 24px 0 32px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  text-shadow: 3px 3px 0 var(--accent);\n  line-height: 1;\n}\n\n.controls {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 12px;\n  justify-content: center;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\nbutton {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1.25rem;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  padding: 14px 24px;\n  border: 3px solid var(--accent);\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  background: transparent;\n  color: var(--text);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 0.15s, transform 0.1s, box-shadow 0.15s;\n  min-width: 64px;\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #0f0f1a;\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: var(--card);\n}\n\nbutton:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid var(--text);\n  outline-offset: 3px;\n}\n\nbutton:active {\n  transform: translateY(4px);\n  box-shadow: none;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .card { padding: 30px 20px; }\n  #count { font-size: 3rem; }\n  button { font-size: 1rem; padding: 12px 18px; }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "(function () {\n  'use strict';\n\n  var countEl = document.getElementById('count');\n  var count = 0;\n\n  function render() {\n    countEl.textContent = String(count);\n  }\n\n  document.getElementById('increase').addEventListener('click', function () {\n    count += 1;\n    render();\n  });\n\n  document.getElementById('decrease').addEventListener('click', function () {\n    count -= 1;\n    render();\n  });\n\n  document.getElementById('reset').addEventListener('click', function () {\n    count = 0;\n    render();\n  });\n\n  render();\n})();",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Counter\n\nAn offline pixel-style counter built with plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. No dependencies, no storage, no network requests.\n\n## Features\n\n- Starts at 0 and supports negative numbers\n- Three buttons: **+** (increase), **-** (decrease), **Reset** (back to zero)\n- Large `#count` output showing only the integer\n- Keyboard-accessible buttons with visible focus, hover, and pressed states\n- Responsive card layout that works from 360px wide\n\n## Usage\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser. Click or tap the buttons to change the count.\n\n## Keyboard\n\n- `Tab` / `Shift+Tab` to move between buttons\n- `Enter` or `Space` to activate the focused button\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — markup and structure\n- `style.css` — pixel-themed styling and responsive layout\n- `script.js` — counter logic using `addEventListener`\n\nNo external assets, fonts, or libraries are used.",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
